            <ArticleTitle>Mechanistic investigation of the formation of H2 from HCOOH with a dinuclear Ru model complex for formate hydrogen lyase.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>870-876</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/14686996.2017.1379857</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the mechanistic investigation of catalytic H2 evolution from formic acid in water using a formate-bridged dinuclear Ru complex as a formate hydrogen lyase model. The mechanistic study is based on isotope-labeling experiments involving hydrogen isotope exchange reaction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
